          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 74483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonun çağrılmasını adını kodlayarak tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayCash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot; Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(money + currency);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayCash();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"118\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>displayCash</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Braces",
            "id": 74532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir satırda <code>365</code> ve sonraki satırda <code>Days a year</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>365</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Days a year</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir satırda <code>365</code> ve sonraki satırda <code>Days a year</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>daysAYear()</code> sonraki günlükten önce çalıştığında konsola önce hangi değer ulaşır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"daysAYear\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"365\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"daysAYear();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Days a year&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"365\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Days a year\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>daysAYear()</code> sonraki günlükten önce çalıştığı için <code>365</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonun dışında olduğu için <code>Days a year</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her iki değer de aynı satırda görünür.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>daysAYear()</code> sonraki günlükten önce çalıştığı için <code>365</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74639,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyondaki parametre nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parametre yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>user</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Program <code>addUser(\"Mina\")</code> çağrısı yaparsa kopyalanan fonksiyonun içinde <code>\"Mina\"</code> değerini hangi ad alır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Added: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>user</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonun parametresi olmadığı için hiçbir ad bu değeri almaz.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>user</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonu çağır ve ona bir değer ilet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>removeUser</code>, ardından <code>\"Lisa\"</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>removeUser</code> fonksiyonunu tamamla, ardından konsolun Lisa'nın kaldırıldığını bildirmesi için <code>\"Lisa\"</code> değeriyle çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeUser\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Removed: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeUser(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lisa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Removed: Lisa\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>user</code>, ardından <code>removeUser</code>, <code>\"Lisa\"</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pass parameters",
            "id": 74571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametreler ne işe yarar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parametreler, fonksiyonlara belirli bilgileri aktarmamıza yardımcı olur</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parametreler fonksiyonları çağırmayı kolaylaştırır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parametreler, değişkenleri konsolda görüntülememizi sağlar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parametreler, fonksiyonlara belirli bilgileri aktarmamıza yardımcı olur.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>greet</code> fonksiyonu her çağrıldığında farklı bir ad görüntülemeli. Değişen bu ad için ne kullanmalı?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">name gibi bir parametre.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonun içinde sabit bir ad string’i.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her fonksiyon çağrısında aynı ad string’i.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">name gibi bir parametre.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
