          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona bir parametre ekle ve ardından onu bir değerle çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temp</code>, ardından <code>60</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonu tamamlayıp <code>60</code> sayısını aktar. Önce <code>Current temp:</code>, ardından bu sayıyı yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Current temp:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatureUpdate(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;60&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Current temp:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"60\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatureUpdate</code>, ardından <code>temp</code> ve son olarak <code>60</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing a value ",
            "id": 74648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonu çağırmayı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"totalWeight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" measurement = \" /><text value=\"&quot; grams&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + measurement);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"totalWeight(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"111\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"250 grams\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>totalWeight</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Using the return value",
            "id": 74685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyona return değeri eklediğimizde ne olur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyon, kendisini çağıran koda bir değer döndürür</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon artık display ifadelerini kullanamaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bu, fonksiyonu yalnızca bir kez çağırabileceğimiz anlamına gelir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyon, kendisini çağıran koda bir değer döndürür.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const total = addTen(20)</code>, <code>30</code> döndüren bir fonksiyonu çağırır. <code>total</code> içinde ne saklanır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonun kendisi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>30</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
