            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>result</code> değişkenini oluştur ve fonksiyonu bir değerle çağırmanın sonucunu bu değişkende sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"moreThanTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = moreThanTen(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>result</code> ve sonra <code>moreThanTen</code>, <code>14</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
